5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! Let's find the werewolf together! I'm so excited to play!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Let's keep a cool head. We need to observe everyone's behavior carefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. Logic and observation will be our best tools here.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Indeed. Let's avoid emotional reactions and focus on the contradictions in our statements.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Such a predictable start. I'll be watching all of you from the sidelines for now.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that sounds a bit scary! Why are you being so mysterious?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's just a style of play, Rin. Let's not get distracted by personality traits.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. We have no information yet. It's too early to draw conclusions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,I'm simply observing. The way you all react to a little pressure is quite revealing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I want to find the bad guy fast! Do you think the werewolf is acting shy?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Haste leads to mistakes. We should wait for the Seer to gather some data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. The first day is for establishing a baseline of how everyone speaks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll be analyzing the patterns of agreement and disagreement in the coming turns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,How diligent. I wonder who among you is actually hiding something behind that diligence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm going to be a great detective! I'll find the werewolf for sure!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's hope so. I'll be watching the flow of the conversation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll do the same. Let's see what the first night brings us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
