31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! I did some investigating last night!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, you can't investigate at night unless you're the Seer. Are you claiming?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's be careful. A premature claim can be a trap or a mistake.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Rin's excitement often leads to imprecise language. It's likely just a figure of speech.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"How clumsy. If you're the Seer, Rin, you should be more discreet. Or are you lying?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! But I'll keep my secret for a little bit longer! Hehe!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Toshio,,That's a vague answer. It doesn't help us narrow down the suspects.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, if you are the Seer, please consider the risk of being attacked tonight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,The most logical move for a Seer is to wait until they have a confirmed human.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,Or they wait until they can frame someone. This game is becoming interesting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I already know one person is a good person! I won't say who yet!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, your behavior is erratic. It's making it difficult to trust your claims.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Let's look at the others. Shion has been very provocative since the start.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Provocation is a common tactic for both the werewolf and a villager trying to flush them out.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, targeting me just because I'm honest about my observations is a bit simplistic, isn't it?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,I think we should look at who is being too mean! Mean people might be werewolves!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"That's not a logical basis for a vote. However, we must execute someone today.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If we can't find a clear lead, we might have to rely on a calculated risk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I suspect Shion's attempts to deflect attention by analyzing others are a cover.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"A logical leap, Asuka. But if you want to gamble on me, go ahead. I'm curious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
