64,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Shion is gone. Now we need to determine if we hit the werewolf or just a villager.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Shion's attitude was suspicious, but it could have been a bluff. We need more info.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The fact that Rin was attacked suggests the werewolf viewed her as a threat or a useful sacrifice.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, you're the only one who hasn't been targeted by suspicion yet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,That's true. Asuka has been very neutral and logical. Almost too perfect.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Asuka,,Being logical is not a crime. It is the most efficient way to ensure the village wins.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If Shion wasn't the werewolf, we have a werewolf and a possessed left among three people.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,Which means the odds are high that the werewolf is still here. We must be precise.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, your sudden focus on me is a shift in pattern. Are you trying to lead the vote?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I am simply assessing the remaining possibilities. Mizuki, what is your conclusion?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe Asuka's neutrality is a mask. The werewolf often hides in plain sight.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will vote based on who shows the most inconsistency. Currently, that is Toshio.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
